=== Background information ===
Jankom Pog is voiced by [[Jason Mantzoukas]].

According to his official {{dis|Nickelodeon|channel}} description:
<blockquote>
A stubborn, stout, 16-year-old Tellarite engineer, Jankom Pog loves to tinker, fix, create, and reconfigure (even when he's not supposed to). Like all Tellarites, he rarely backs down from an argument, and loves to play "devil's advocate." Some might find him cranky, but Jankom always gets the job done and has yet to find an engine he can't fix with his trusty Multi-Mitt. Jankom loves food and referring to himself in the third person. {{el|nick.com/shows/star-trek-prodigy}}
</blockquote>

