One of the Noums appeared as the emcee, another Noum had his [[fedora]] snatched by [[Murf]] as he began his set, while another watched on. Later, when Pog and [[Dal R'El]] took and opened [[briefcase]] containing [[gold-pressed latinum]] being exchanged from a Human gangster and another Noum lookalike, the gangsters chased the ''Protostar'' crew through the club until they escaped to the next sim.

